====== TP-Link TL-WDR4310 ======
Dual Band (concurrent) and Gigabit Ethernet.
Advertised as 750 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 Ghz Band and Triple-Stream (3x3) on the 5 Ghz Band. WDR4310 owners should reference the better maintained WDR4300 page. [[tl-wdr4300_v1|TP-Link TL-WDR4300]]

